OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found sister's body and
OL,4,Aknifeman, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has described running out of a
OL,7,Fhouse in fear after finding her
OL,8,Fsister's body and a man holding a large
OL,9,Fknife.
OL,11,FIn a police video played at Winchester
OL,12,FCrown Court, Arleta Derkacz said she
OL,13,Fdiscovered her sister dead in a bedroom
OL,14,Fafter Stephen Sexton claimed she was
OL,15,Fnot in the property.
OL,17,FSexton, from Totton, Hampshire, denies
OL,18,Fraping and murdering 37-year-old Joanna
OL,19,FDerkacz at her home in Waterlooville in
OL,20,FDecember 2023 shortly after she had
OL,21,Fbroken up with him.
